Reynard Gecko patches

Parts of the initial iOS target/toolchain, UIKit widget, process/bootstrap,
GeckoView embedding and SpiderMonkey JIT memory adaptations were adapted
from or informed by the MPL-2.0 Gecko patches in minh-ton/reynard-browser.

Reference: https://github.com/minh-ton/reynard-browser
Reference commit: a0794ff252c5c52040bb4f7419dba110233d4102

GeckoPort/PATCHSET.lock preserves this attribution and reference revision.
ChatWeb's canonical patch includes subsequent project modifications. The
GPL-3.0 Reynard browser application and its UI are not included or linked.

Source for the prebuilt runtime

The corresponding source inputs are the exact Firefox revision above,
GeckoPort/ChatWeb-Gecko.patch, the build configuration under GeckoPort/,
and the runtime staging, trimming, packaging and path-sanitizing scripts
under scripts/. README.md and GeckoPort/README.md describe how to obtain
the pinned source and rebuild GeckoPrebuilt/GeckoCore-ios-arm64.zip.
